Buy more at discount!
Nanjing real estate market sees “difference compensation” again - ChinaNetNewsCenter
In an interview with Yanko Evening News (journalist Marubo) Janko Evening/Uchio Journalist 10, it was found that the price-fixing agreement, which had not been seen for more than a decade, had returned to Nanjing City, and that a building located in the Jiangbei Xinjiang district declared that it was “payable for the difference” and that other sources of housing before the transfer were more favourable than the previous discount, and that the developers were willing to change the house for the buyer and refund the difference.
There are a number of terms of a “price agreement”
The building, which is located in Jiangxi's New District, is known as the Puliyan Yuzhou Cloud Tower, and the owner of the building, Mr. Sun, told reporters that he found a brick-and-mortar declaration of brick-and-mortar when he rented the building last weekend.
The photographs he sent to reporters show that the developer's pledge that if the property was purchased between February 1 and February 28 from the date of the purchase and sale contract between the two parties until the delivery of the corresponding source of housing, the developer can change the house for the buyer and refund the difference if the discount on other homes in the project is greater than the discount on the previous purchase of the house (the limit is the same as the house, the same building block, the same unit, other unsold commodity houses of the same property type), the developer can change the house for the buyer and refund the difference.
Mr. Sun said that the sales consultant explained that this was just an “insurance agreement” – to give buyers peace of mind when they sell and not worry about developers lowering their prices for promotional purposes. "Now I’m afraid that once we buy it, it will be lowered in price anyway; going to the sales office to protest won’t leave me time to do so, and if I don’t protest, it’s really nice."
There is still another group of homebuyers who think that while “guaranteed price agreements” are given to buyers as a promise to keep them calm, the terms are not so low.
Ms Zheng, who is planning to buy an affordable property in Jiangbei, says that properties with price guarantees must be of the same model and have similar layouts within the same building as well as in the same unit, so there aren’t many comparable options for buyers anyway. Thus, the threshold remains high.
Also, some buyers argue that it is not easy for them to "protect their rights" during transactions due to asymmetry of information, as sellers may offer additional discounts outside of the public offer when there is none mentioned.
It remains to be seen whether the buyer can be retained.
Reporters inquired about real estate in Nanjing online and learned that the property was sold in November last year for a total of 252 apartment blocks with 105 square meters, 114 square meters, 129 square meters, and a total renovation sale of 39843 yuan/m2.
However, more than two months ago, online real estate showed a total of 157 unsold sets, or 62.3 per cent, of the current stock of the building, with a total of 128 units in building 8, 113 units in total, 44 units in 124 units in building 7, and a total of 33 sets in total, or only 13 per cent.
Market participants explain that "price protection agreements" also appeared in Nanjing in 2008.
In August of that year, the housing project Xiangtang Xiyuan on Huangshan Road West in Heguo launched the "Price Guarantee Plan" to attract homebuyers. The specifics of the plan were as follows: "The company solemnly commits that if the project offers further discounts within a year, the difference will be refunded to the original owners by the company."
Since then, in April 2011, nine properties in Nanjing have also taken out some of the housing promises to compensate for the difference in prices.
The real estate market is warming up, and now more than ever requires a ‘shot of adrenaline.’
Mr. Shen, a senior operator in the Nanjing real estate industry, said that the PPP is also one of the marketing methods for real estate companies.
He believes that enterprises need more confidence than homebuyers at the moment, and launching a "price guarantee agreement" is actually boosting their morale.
As to the ability to retain buyers, he said that it depended on the influence of multiple factors, such as regulatory policies, loan thresholds and so on, which remained to be seen at the present time.
China's rescue team continues to carry out rescue operations in Turkey and has rescued four trapped individuals so far - Xinhua News Agency
Xinhua News Agency报道，according to the website of the Ministry of Emergency Management on February 11th, on February 10th, the Chinese rescue team currently searching for survivors in Turkey dispatched three operational teams and 45 rescue personnel, rescuing one trapped person.
At the same time, two search and assessment teams were dispatched to conduct an assessment and screening of 15 buildings on Vodabash Street.
So far, a total of four people have been rescued, five people have been identified, and life signs and risk assessments have been carried out on 25 buildings that collapsed severely.
The rescue team will adjust its relief force scientifically based on the actual situation in the disaster area and conditions at the scene of assistance. It will continue to deepen the rescue work.
The rescue teams obtain rescue求助 information through various channels such as embassies, local governments, and UN relief organizations, and verify each case through multiple methods including online inquiries and on-site searches.
To introduce the current rescue environment and conditions of building collapses to China’s Hong Kong Rescue Team and jointly carry out search operations.
The SSC5 is currently responsible for regional coordination with the Italian Rescue Team, while sending three teams to work in the Regional Rescue Coordination Centre No. 5, to communicate with teams from Italy, the United Kingdom, Serbia, Slovakia, and Oman, and to learn about the work of the United Nations Rescue Organization and the rescue teams of the countries.
Rescue teams continue to strengthen the security management and security of the squad, in accordance with the principle of uniform command, safety first, strengthening the security control in the rescue site, strengthening the disciplinary requirements of the rescue work, and clarifying safety precautions.
Continued operation of the rotational reserve and standby work system, strengthening the security management of the camp.
The medical staff of rescue teams provide physical examinations for team members on an ongoing basis and enhance health protection measures for key personnel. At present, all members of the rescue team are physically fit and healthy; they have carried out disinfection operations in their base camp.
After establishing their own campsite, the logistics support team has set up 4 major categories of tents – command communication, equipment storage, medical decontamination, living accommodation, and dog kennels – totaling 26 tents to ensure that more than 30 sets of on-site rescue equipment were available for use.
Kim Jong-un's father and daughter interacted intimately and his wife froze to death.
The 75th anniversary parade was held in North Korea on the evening of the 8th, and Kim Jong-un's daughter, Kim Jong-il, not only attended, but also stood on the chair with her father.
North Korean state media released footage on Sunday showing Kim Ju-ah hugging her father close, making affectionate eye contact and whispering to him several times. She gently held her father's cheek with her hands, even touching his chest. The father-and-daughter interaction was broadcast to the whole country.
However, the First Lady, Lord Li Shei, could only step aside.
According to reports from "The Korean People's Newspaper" and others, on the official photo taken by Kim Jong-un and Lee Seo-ju couple on their daughter Kim Ji-ae’s 7th birthday dinner, Kim Ji-ae was seen sitting in the middle C seat, which is rarely seen. Moreover, on the 75th anniversary of the Army Day military parade the following evening, she was seen alongside Kim Jong-un on the dais together.
The "Korean Central Television" of North Korea released footage after the military parade showing more scenes of father and daughter love.
Kim Jong-un looked at his daughter several times on the podium, the smiles on both faces never retreated and whispered in each other's ears, and Kim loved to hold his father's cheeks with his hands, and Kim Jong-un responded with a grinning smile.
Other official media footage also showed Lady Gaga touching her father's face with her hands while sitting on Kim Jong-un's couch in the living room; she touched Kim Jong-un's chest with her hands as she walked with him.
The First Lady, Li Shei, had to walk behind her back or sit by her side, always a few steps away from her husband and daughter.
Korean media note that since Kim Jong-un first appeared in public in late November last year following his test launch of the Nodong-17 missile, his chances of appearing in public have increased over the past three months, and he has now appeared at official functions five times so far.
The official media in North Korea used high-level titles such as the most beloved son, the noble son, when referring to Kim Jong-il, and also broadcasted a clip of Kim Jong-il repeatedly shouting his death in support of white bloodlines as he watched the parade on the stage.
These signals have led outside observers to doubt whether Kim Il-sung’s successor is already chosen, and The Washington Post analysts saw in that as a signal for Kim Jong-un putting his teenage daughter on the throne. However, some believe that this assessment may still be premature since there are various possibilities still available when it comes to the succession of Kim Jong-un who has a son at his side.
"The Fund E Account" is here: The CSRC authorizes development, allowing all of an investor's funds under management to be pooled and queried - Economic Observation Net - Professional Financial News Website
Economic Observer reporter Chen Shan The difficulty of aggregating account information due to the complexity of fund purchase channels?
Always forgetting about the "slush fund"?
These issues of Ki-min are about to be resolved.
February 10, the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) announced that the "Fund E Account" APP has been launched and is currently undergoing public trial operation on various mobile app stores.
According to the introduction, "Fund E Account" provides one-stop service for individual investors to query information on all kinds of open-end funds including account number and share details, aiming at solving industry pain points such as forgotten account numbers and cumbersome inquiry processes among large number of small and medium-sized investors.
According to Wind data, as of the end of 2022, there were 156 public fund managers in the country, with a management fund size of about 26 trillion yuan; 167 public fund share registration institutions and 411 public fund sales institutions.
Each share registration institution has an independent account system and there is no industry-wide unified query channel.
Industry insiders stated that at the end of 2021, China had more than 720 million fund investors, meaning that half of the country's population had invested in fund products.
Previously, investors had to check their purchases through different sales institutions, but with the “Fund E Account,” all information about purchases from all销售渠道 can be readily accessed, making it clear at a glance what funds they hold.
What is the "Fund E Account" APP?
According to relevant documents, "Fund E Account" APP is an official mobile application developed and constructed by the China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation with approval from the China Securities Regulatory Commission, offering a one-stop query of the holdings of all market open-end fund products for investors.
Investors can easily and quickly gain control of their holdings in the open market fund product market of fund managers purchased through sales channels across the market, improving the overall efficiency of inquiries.
Specifically, investors can query through the “Fund E Account” information including: fund account information opened with all public offering fund managers, trading account information opened with public offering fund sales institutions, and the holdings of products such as open-end shares of publicly offered securities investment funds and collective asset management plans established by securities companies where the number of investors is not subject to a limit of 200 people.
Yang Qikun, head of business for the Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center, told the Economic Observer that investors can get all information about their ETF holdings through the "Fund E Account" app in one go, helping them recover "forgotten assets." More importantly, it enables clients to consolidate comprehensive fund investment information across accounts, allowing clients to better understand their investment situation in real time and accurately. This, in turn, helps clients optimize their fund portfolio more effectively and better plan their financial arrangements.
How do I register and use?
The reporter noted that at the moment, the Apple Fund E account Apple App is already available in mobile app stores such as Huawei, Apple, Xiaomi, OPPO, Vivo, but the app is still in the open trial phase, registration requires filling out an invitation form and investors can contact the fund manager who holds the fund to obtain it.
A customer service staff from a mid-to-large-sized public fund management company in Shanghai provided a six-digit invitation code to an Economic Observer reporter and said, "During the beta testing phase of the app, China Securities Clearing provides each fund manager with a certain number of invitation codes. Investors can call to obtain them, and we provide them all."
After the end of the trial run, no invitation code is needed to open user registration.
Translation requested.
According to the official website of the Supervisory Board, the journalist downloaded and used the documentation to register the account and completed the inquiry, which took only a few minutes and was mainly divided into four steps: user registration, identity verification, fund account binding, public procurement fund inquiry.
After the physical name certification step, click on the “assets” fund binding button, and all Fund products purchased by journalists through the respective fund sales platforms are presented in the binding options list (a binding account), and the binding is completed so that the total assets of the invested fund can be viewed directly and the query function can be started.
Notably, the “Fund E Account” provides querying services for investors but does not facilitate buying or selling.
The data displayed on the "Fund E Account" usually corresponds to the date three trading days prior to the query date (T day).
For example, on February 10th, when you open the "Fund E Account," the total assets, fund shares, and net asset value displayed under the Asset page correspond to the date three trading days prior to that, which is February 7th.
