! I am sorry for such a scholarly spirit.
There is no literary evaluation, and there is a distinction between the two families.
Overall 2 stars.
Excellent shopping.
Great stuff!
I still trust Amazon’s own goods. Since I started shopping overseas via Amazon Express, it has been very convenient and the shipping time from abroad to China is only a few days longer than domestic shipments, which means that Amazon's customs clearance capabilities for overseas purchases have definitely been stronger than those of transit services, making them much faster, so many people now buy things on Amazon Express.
I hope the quality and prices of domestically produced goods could be better, many things are made domestically but buying them overseas is cheaper than buying them domestically, I hope to improve this.
Got someone else's unwrapped gift.
Having over three hundred machines and paying one hundred plus in tax is indeed quite high; now that it’s around six hundred, it feels much more reasonable in my mind.
Upon receiving it, the sealing tape looked very damaged as if it had been opened, so I took photos immediately. Indeed, it ripped easily once opened, and after opening, I noticed the inner cardboard was already damaged. Worried it might be someone who returned it before the anniversary, I tested it on my husband right away. To my surprise, there was no electricity in the device, fortunately the blade inside was free of burrs, otherwise, how would it have been possible to return it all the way from here!
Whether it is good and practical or if there might be short-term issues remains unknown, just as with previous reviews, items sent when out of stock are unreliable!
The items are still good, but Amazon's customer service is much worse than that of other websites.
After placing an order and realizing it was placed incorrectly, but there is no way to cancel the order, the online customer service always displays an error link that cannot be contacted.
After I received the delivery, the delivery person called me and said that I didn't want it and tried to cancel the order, but the cancellation failed. The delivery person then took the item back and asked me to sign for it first, before informing me to apply for a return.
When making a return request, it is only then that one is informed that once food items are delivered and signed for, they cannot be returned, and contacting Amazon customer service is of no avail; just like, once delivered and signed for, food items cannot be returned.
I have bought items that cannot be returned under policy from both JD and Suning before, including milk and diapers, and contacted customer service in both cases, and they were refunded. Even when I had to return Suning's diapers because of an overwhelming smell, the customer service agreed to refund it. However, at Amazon, this is not the case for me.
The rules are dead, people are alive. How did you handle contacting your customer service?
Tell me to either take it myself or let the delivery person buy it themselves. After all, delivery people don't have an easy job; why should I make them pay for something they didn't purchase?
Okay, I won't be retreating either; I'll accept it myself and will give your service one star.
Amazon's own products shouldn't feature such items.
The price of the product is not low, and it is also good to see the reviews.
Upon actually receiving the product, I was shocked; the surface was heavily worn, and there were other areas of wear as well. It was either a defective item or an old one. I will post images later.
I am applying for a return; the manufacturer's people say it was caused by transportation, is this not nonsense?
How can anything inside a product wear out?
There are only two possibilities: either it is defective second-hand merchandise, or I deliberately damaged the item in order to return it for a refund.
Objectively, I have no evidence to prove that I damaged the product, but considering my shopping record on Amazon, I believe such a product should not be in Amazon's own-brand items. Customers choose Amazon's own-brand because they trust it; customer wins, we win, the victory of the customer is also the victory of the manufacturer. Let's all work together to improve this. Thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate; the error is within acceptable limits. A certificate of jewelry appraisal is included in the packaging, and at 12 o'clock on the dial is real diamond. This piece is very suitable to wear and is also highly prestigious as a gift to give out.
Yes, it is indeed excellent.
Lightweight and High-Capacity
I like how light it is and big in size; but I find having two separate partition bags redundant for me. I'm not sure what to put in each one.
After buying, I found that there was another brand similar product on Overseas Purchase from Meijia for less than 200 yuan.
There was a problem with the first purchase; all the lights were flashing and not functional.
We want a refund; it took three days to receive the goods in Shanghai and they have not been delivered.
The delivery person's phone is not answered.
The courier said they only had that contact.
Amazon is unable to find a place for complaints.
No request was made, and in the event of a delay in delivery, there was no reason to delay delivery at my request — such a text message came.
What else is there to say about the transit issue?
After all, the poor shopping experience has me questioning the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics and control systems.
It seems I won't be able to get it today.
